itself expand the mandatory routing control to standalone fee payments.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"Whether the selected event is an application or submission to IPD concerning an investment product administered by IPD, interpreted with the listed product categories. Classification of borderline events requires judgment.","name":"is_covered_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528","d19f9ecf9fd26.u16.2270"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Gregorian date of the selected submission event. Selecting the operative event for attempted, incomplete or continued filings may require judgment.","name":"submission_date","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"Whether the selected application or submission was submitted to IPD through e-IP.","name":"submitted_via_e_ip","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"submitted_via_e_ip","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_covered_submission (>= submission_date (date 2024-11-30)))"},"local_id":"reading_1_refined","questions":["Does the unavailable launch circular establish transitional treatment or an exception for any covered submission?","What event determines submission_date for an attempted, incomplete, amended or resubmitted filing?","Does an operational failure permit an alternative channel under material absent from this packet?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For one covered application or submission whose submission event falls on or after 30 November 2024, true means that the selected mandatory routing control is met because the event used e-IP; false means that the routing control is unmet. Outside this scope, no compliance determination is made. Unknown facts remain unknown. This is a proposed interpretation of the sup