\\":\\\"modality\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"Must establishes mandatory routing. Can also permits annual-fee settlement through e-IP; the full-adoption heading does not make that payment route mandatory. SFC statements about extension, integration and enhancement announce administrative actions. Contacting case officers is an invitation, not a prerequisite or waiver procedure.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0\\\",\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u6.1187\\\",\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u7.1505\\\",\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528\\\",\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u10.2035\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"PROPOSED\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"time\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"Launch was 29 July 2024. The extension replaces the initial 29 October endpoint with 29 November 2024; mandatory routing starts 30 November 2024. Continued existing-channel acceptance during the extended month is inferred from extending the parallel run. Treatment of filings spanning cutover and independent integration or fee-function availability dates remain unspecified.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0\\\",\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u2.439\\\",\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u3.737\\\",\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u6.1187\\\",\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"dependencies\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The 8 July 2024 launch circular is expressly referenced but unavailable. The packet's missing dependency identifier is only provisionally associated with it. Its definitions, procedures and exceptions cannot be imported. The supplied text supports the bounded routing proposal, not complete treatment across related authority.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u2.439\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"Does the unavailable 8 July 2024 launch circular establish transitional treatment, category-specific qualifi